    "scope": "Unchanged accepted interpolation/table/tick core plus exact pinned AudioScheduledSource ceil start, first partial quantum and OscillatorHandler constant/a-rate offset/count rules. Native TimeToSampleFrame rounds to1/1024sample before requestedceil; original fractional remainder is retained for the separate positive/negative scheduling adjustment."
